&lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;a) Sel=
ect the Start button, then select Settings &gt;=0A                            =
                        Devices &gt; Printers &amp; scanners &gt; Add a printer or=0A=
                                                    scanner.&lt;/p&gt;=0A        =
                                        &lt;p&gt;b) Wait for it to find nearby pr=
inters, then choose the=0A                                                 =
   one you want to use, and select Add device. If you want=0A              =
                                      to remove the printer later, just hig=
hlight it and=0A                                                    select =
Remove.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A                                              =
  &lt;h3 class=3D&quot;my-4&quot;&gt;Setup a New Printer (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A=0A                  =
                              &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                  =
                  1.Prepare your printer:=0A                               =
                 &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                           =
     &lt;p&gt;Use the instructions that came with your printer to=0A             =
                                       unpack the printer, install ink or t=
oner, and add paper.=0A                                                    =
Turn on the printer and make sure it=E2=80=99s not displaying=0A           =
                                         any errors.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A             =
                                   &lt;strong&gt;=0A                             =
                       2. Connect your printer: Follow the instructions tha=
t=0A                                                    came with the print=
er to connect it to the network.=0A                                        =
        &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;=
=0A                                                    If you have a Wi-Fi =
printer, you might need to connect=0A                                      =
              the printer to your Mac with a USB cable to set up Wi-Fi=0A  =
                                                  printing. After connectin=
g the printer to your Mac,=0A                                              =
      install the Mac software that came with the printer and=0A           =
                                         use the printer=E2=80=99s setup as=
sistant to connect the printer=0A                                          =
          to your Wi-Fi network. After setting up, you can=0A              =
                                      disconnect the cable from your printe=
r and Mac and the=0A                                                    pri=
nter should remain connected to the Wi-Fi network.=0A                      =
                          &lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                                       =
         &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                    3. =
Add the printer to your list of available printers:=0A                     =
                           &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                 =
               &lt;p&gt;=0A                                                    Ch=
oose Apple menu &gt; System Settings, then click Printers=0A                  =
                                  &amp; Scanners in the sidebar. (You may need =
to scroll=0A                                                    down.)&lt;/p&gt;=
=0A=0A                                                &lt;strong&gt;=0A          =
                                          4. When your printer appears in t=
he list, select your=0A                                                    =
printer, then click Add.=0A                                                =
&lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt; It ma=
y take a minute or two for your printer to appear.=0A                      =
                              If you see a message prompting you to downloa=
d new=0A                                                    software, make =
sure to download and install it.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A                              =
                  &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                              =
      5. If you do not see your printer listed on the left,=0A             =
                                       click the Add Printer, Scanner or Fa=
x button on the=0A                                                    right=
.=0A                                                &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A        =
                                        &lt;p&gt;=0A                             =
                       A dialogue appears listing printers on your local ne=
twork.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                            &lt;/div&gt;=0A         =
